# Supabase Configuration
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key-here

# === DOMAIN SETUP (volyume.app) ===
#
# 1. In Supabase dashboard → Authentication → URL Configuration
#    - Site URL:      https://volyume.app
#    - Redirect URLs: volyume://
#                     https://volyume.app/**
#
# 2. For custom email auth (optional):
#    Settings → Auth → SMTP Settings
#    - Use white-labeled SMTP from noreply@volyume.app
#    - Customize email templates to point to https://volyume.app
#
# 3. Universal linking (automatic once domain is set):
#    - iOS: .well-known/apple-app-site-association (see DOMAIN_SETUP.md)
#    - Android: .well-known/assetlinks.json (see DOMAIN_SETUP.md)
#
# See DOMAIN_SETUP.md for full setup instructions
